WEBVTT

00:15:28.340 --> 00:15:32.302
Now, Marvin Minsky
called alternative intelligence

00:15:32.344 --> 00:15:34.930
our "mind children."

00:15:34.972 --> 00:15:38.684
Could we as proud parents accept

00:15:38.684 --> 00:15:41.770
that the new generation
that we will create

00:15:41.770 --> 00:15:44.022
will be smarter than we are?

00:15:44.022 --> 00:15:48.193
And could we accept
that the new generation we create

00:15:48.193 --> 00:15:51.655
need not be on a substrate made of meat?

00:15:51.655 --> 00:15:52.948
Thank you.

00:15:52.948 --> 00:15:59.830
(Applause)

00:15:59.830 --> 00:16:01.081
Thank you.